 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Great. And how many bikes do you end up with? Then probably not that. I' lean towards the commuting helmet for everyday use, then. It's the one you're sure to use for trips around the city. The road helmet is great if you do serious riding and want the vents, and the folding one is nice if you want the compact design. But I'd gamble on time spent sitting in traffic versus the occasional compactness of the folding one",
